"links":[["Bedford County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/pennsylvania/bedford-county"],["ARC or PLC in Bedford County","/arc-plc/pennsylvania/bedford-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 176% of normal in May to June and 38% in August to September. Grid 23907 had its driest year in 1991 at 67% of normal. For grid 23606 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 is 107.4.</p>"}
